Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?HOME-ALMRESET-2:=20the=20full-HOME=20alarm-rese?=
 =?UTF-8?q?t=20/=20servo-on=20check=20(case=20302)=20no=20longer=20stops?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20HOME=20falsely.=20EastSun=201003=20'=E4=BD=A0alarm=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=85=A8=E6=A9=9F=E6=AD=B8=E5=8E=9F=E9=BB=9E=E5=B0=B1=E8=A6=81?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=81=9C=E4=BA=86'=20/=20'M14=20=E6=B2=92=E6=9C=89=20ALARM=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=98=BF':=20(1)=20the=20Galil-routed=20Index=20Z=20(M14=20MTe?=
 =?UTF-8?q?stZ1)=20never=20got=20Led[iServoOn]=20from=20ScanMotorStatus,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20so=20it=20always=20read=20SERVO-OFF=20--=20now=20read=20with?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20golden's=20own=20Gali=5FScanMotStatusTIMO=20(MG=5FMOY)=20lik?=
 =?UTF-8?q?e=20the=20Galil=20home=20case=208;=20(2)=20the=20motor=20power?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20relay=20comes=20back=20~4=20s=20after=20HOME=20starts=20(18:?=
 =?UTF-8?q?36:53=201->0,=2018:36:57=200->1),=20so=20abnormal=20axes=20get?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Alarm=20Reset=20+=20Servo=20ON=20again=20every=201=20s=20and?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20only=20count=20as=20abnormal=20after=2020=20retries=20(~20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20s).=20ctest=20homeclass=20/=20HomeMonitor=20/=20HomeBlock=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?/=20NoteMotorError=20/=20Pci1203MotorRoute=20/=20EcatMotorRoute?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20/=20GaliRoute*=20pass?=
